The {{Term/Store|Rubber Tights|Rubber Tights|Series, BotW, TotK}} are a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Rubber Tights can be acquired in the [[Qukah Nata Shrine]] after completing the [[Shrine Quest]] "[[A Song of Storms]]" in [[Calora Lake]]. When worn, they provide [[Link]] with one level of [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They, along with the [[Rubber Helm]] and [[Rubber Armor]], compose the [[Rubber Armor (Set)|Rubber Armor]] set, which makes Link [[Unshockable]] when worn. Rubber Tights can be both enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

